    <string name="onboarding_kit_title">Your recovery kit</string>
    <string name="onboarding_kit_explanation">This is a spare key to your account. If you lose all your devices, your Account ID and recovery key get your account back. Keep them secret. You see them only now, so save them somewhere safe.</string>
